  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "水薸"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>葉佳琪</b></span></p><p><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">天氣漸漸仔熱　是蓮花beh開ê日子</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我tī水面　浮沉</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">無親像蓮花有蓮藕（liân-ngāu）釘tī水底</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kan-na有短短ná喙鬚ê</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">根</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">水底　碰bē著</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">塗沙　掠bē tiâu</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一tsūn風吹--來</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">又koh是生份ê所在</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">春天沓沓仔行遠　是動物生湠ê時tsūn</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">舊年hit對水ka-līng</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄知影　kám ē koh來做siū--無？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">今年ê熱--人</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄知影　iáu-koh聽ē著am-poo-tsê ê歌聲--無？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">因為無根ê我</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">無法度一直踮tī tsia</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">東、西、南、北</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">風　uì佗吹</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我tio̍h-ài tuì佗去</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">水　流向佗位</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我mā ài tuè leh去</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我真欣羨有藕ê蓮花</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">春夏秋冬　lóng tī熟sāi ê所在</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我mā真欣羨水底ê魚</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Beh泅去佗　lóng是家己主意</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kan-na我tsit个無根底--ê</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Beh去佗總--是　身不由己</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">今仔日tī tsit條圳</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">明仔載ē tī佗一條溝？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tang時我tsiah有家己ê hit个位？</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhACzvCylsQYcOzD6j2GCPnFDZBPD5uMDocmF5V4CkTqIX22332KrmgDjxz_m6QdRWiIwnsGQoeCOKJ3A_ThuR-y2Hppz1_Vu3wR7gm-9_OyNv76t_apuspLkUPLNCnYexrus1i4FNAGhs_ljaYGhsDcR2NO3_W0INRH3ZTjJHhMbw8NNVgHNgIYER0R26s/s3107/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1375%E6%9C%9F_6.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3107\" data-original-width=\"2221\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhACzvCylsQYcOzD6j2GCPnFDZBPD5uMDocmF5V4CkTqIX22332KrmgDjxz_m6QdRWiIwnsGQoeCOKJ3A_ThuR-y2Hppz1_Vu3wR7gm-9_